","line":54,"embedded":true},{"title":"“Our constitution is founded on the principle that no matter who you are, you get to be who you want to be,” said Zoey Wagner","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/public/latest-news/576m/picture315223719/alternates/FREE_1200/Zoey%20Wagner","line":72,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Protesters decry Idaho’s transgender ‘bathroom bill’ at No Kings rally","source":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/news/politics-government/state-politics/article315222644.html#campaignName=boise_politics_newsletter","author":["[[Mark Dee]]"],"published":"2026-03-28","created":"2026-07-07","description":"“Our constitution is founded on the principle that no matter who you are, you get to be who you want to be,” Boisean Zoey Wagner said."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},